title: Affection
---
<<if get_affection("characterone") <= 10>>
    Midna: I don't really feel like talking right now.
<<else>>
    <<if get_affection("characterone") >= 30>>
        Midna: {$playerName}! I'm really glad to see you again.
    <<elseif get_affection("characterone") >= 20>>
        Midna: It's nice seeing you again, {$playerName}.
    <<else>>
        Midna: Oh, hello {$playerName}.
    <<endif>>
    Midna: How are you finding the village?
    -> I love it here.
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterone" 10>>
        {$playerName}: I love it here.
        <<jump Happy>>
    -> I don't like it.
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterone" -10>>
        {$playerName}: I don't like it.
        <<jump Sad>>
<<endif>>

===
title: Happy
---
<<if get_affection("characterone") >= 30>>
    Midna: That makes me happy to hear.
    Midna: You know, {$playerName}... I've really started looking forward to seeing you.
<<else>>
    Midna: That makes me happy to hear.
<<endif>>
===
title: Sad
---
Midna: Oh...
===
